          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"bill-calculator\">Bill Calculator</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">This interactive notebook calculates electricity bills for residential and\nsmall business customers under different tariff structures.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></span>\n<ul>\n<li>Compare bills with and without solar PV</li>\n<li>Model battery storage to maximise self-consumption</li>\n<li>Explore different tariff types (flat rate, time of use, demand charges)</li>\n<li>Download results for further analysis</li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Use the controls below to configure your scenario and explore the outcomes.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "vblA",
      "code_hash": "065ba7164abab545606ca0b977987a97",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"1-load-data\">1. Load Data</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Choose a data source below: use one of the sample customer profiles, or upload\nyour own CSV file(s) with load and PV generation data.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "emfo",
      "code_hash": "f4b4755857432dc19cd89853df1c594d",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"2-select-tariffs\">2. Select Tariffs</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Use the dropdowns below to filter and select tariffs for comparison.\nThe tariffs are sourced from the CEEM electricity tariff database.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ulZA",
