          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"4-calculate-bills\">4. Calculate Bills</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Once your tariffs have been selected and you've input battery parameters (if you want to add a battery to the calculations), the bill calculations for your input scenario(s) will automatically run.</span></span>"
